# Files the Vercel CLI must not upload: build output and dependencies (Vercel builds and
# installs on its own servers), and the original high-res product photos, which are kept
# locally only (the site uses the small WebP copies in public/; see .gitignore).
node_modules
.output
.vercel
dist
.wrangler
public/Mouthwash/
public/Oralbrush/
public/Totalflux *.png

# Local secrets (e.g. the Vercel CLI's token in .env.local)
.env*
